{"b":"Ps","c":97,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"The LORD reigneth; let the earth rejoice; let the multitude of isles be glad thereof.","it":[[77,85]],"x":[["Ps.96.10",9,"w"],["Ps.96.11",9,"e"],["Col.1.13",6,"r"],["Ps.99.1",6,"e"],["Ps.93.1",5,"w"],["Ps.98.4",4,"e"],["Ps.98.6",4,"r"],["Zeph.2.11",3,"e"],["Isa.49.13",3,"r"],["Rev.11.17",3,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Clouds and darkness are round about him: righteousness and judgment are the habitation of his throne.","it":[[20,23],[68,71]],"x":[["Ps.89.14",9,"e"],["Exod.19.9",7,"r"],["Prov.16.12",5,"w"],["Heb.1.8",5,"w"],["Heb.1.9",5,"w"],["Ps.99.4",4,"w"],["Gen.18.25",4,"r"],["Deut.4.11",3,"w"],["Deut.4.12",3,"r"],["Nah.1.3",3,"w"]]},{"n":3,"t":"A fire goeth before him, and burneth up his enemies round about.","x":[["Ps.50.3",9,"e"],["Ps.18.8",8,"r"],["Heb.12.29",7,"r"],["2Thess.1.8",5,"r"],["Mal.4.1",5,"r"],["Dan.7.10",4,"r"],["Ps.21.8",3,"w"],["Ps.21.9",3,"r"],["Deut.32.22",3,"r"],["Nah.1.5",2,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"His lightnings enlightened the world: the earth saw, and trembled.","x":[["Ps.77.18",6,"e"],["Ps.104.32",5,"r"],["Exod.19.16",4,"w"],["Exod.19.18",4,"r"],["Rev.11.19",4,"w"],["Jer.10.10",2,"r"],["Ps.114.7",2,"r"],["Ps.96.9",2,"r"],["Ps.144.5",2,"r"],["Ps.144.6",2,"r"]]},{"n":5,"t":"The hills melted like wax at the presence of the LORD, at the presence of the Lord of the whole earth.","x":[["Nah.1.5",12,"w"],["Mic.1.3",11,"r"],["Mic.1.4",11,"w"],["Ps.47.2",8,"r"],["Isa.24.19",8,"r"],["Isa.24.20",8,"r"],["Isa.64.1",7,"w"],["Isa.64.2",7,"w"],["Hab.3.6",6,"w"],["Josh.3.11",5,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"The heavens declare his righteousness, and all the people see his glory.","x":[["Ps.19.1",6,"e"],["Ps.50.6",6,"e"],["Isa.66.18",4,"w"],["Isa.6.3",3,"w"],["2Sam.22.47",3,"r"],["Isa.40.5",3,"w"],["Isa.45.6",3,"r"],["Ps.67.4",3,"r"],["Ps.89.2",2,"w"],["Rev.19.2",2,"r"]]},{"n":7,"t":"Confounded be all they that serve graven images, that boast themselves of idols: worship him, all ye gods.","it":[[98,100]],"x":[["Heb.1.6",7,"w"],["Jer.10.14",7,"w"],